shoulders, each strand a gradient of greys, blacks and browns.  Its skin is
predominantly brown, wrinkled and leathery, with frequent and varied patches of
greys, blacks and the occasional dull blue.  From a face set permanently in a
rictus of hatred, two deep indigo eyes look out balefully.    
