General Furcas~
A large slug-like devil grins in anticipation.
~
You see an horrific creature, whose hindquarters look like a slug, if slugs
came four feet around, solidly armored with onyx scales and protected by
hundreds of barbed spines.  His torso is roughly humanoid, with four long,
scaled arms, each ending in a vicious set of retractable claws.  His head,
about six feet off the ground, is heavily armored with two large and curling
horns protruding from the top.  His face consists of two tiny black beady eyes
and a beak-like mouth.    
~
