~
Titivilus is a small devil, very similar in appearance to a satyr.  His lower
body is covered in a blood-red fur, with his legs like those of a goat, ending
in hoofs.  A small black devil's tail twitches behind him, lashing the air
angrily.  His fur thins out and vanishes around his midsection, revealing a
pale white skin.  Two bat-like wings protrude from his back, and his face looks
as if it had been drained of blood.    
